  "description": "Runs NUnit tests inside a .NET MAUI app on a device, simulator or emulator, and reports the results in-app or over TCP.\n\nThis is a fork of NUnit.Maui.Runner by Nikita Romanov (https://github.com/JaneySprings/NUnit-MAUI-Runner), by way of https://github.com/Abhirasmanu-Trimble/NUnit-MAUI-Runner, published so that a build targeting .NET 10 and MAUI 10 is available on NuGet. The assembly name and namespaces are unchanged from upstream, so existing code needs no edits.\n\nFork maintained at https://github.com/mscottford/NUnit-MAUI-Runner.",
